msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Did you know Gelateria Kamuro over on Taihei Boulevard is often packed with "
"businessmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh. Guess there's nothing wrong with guys liking gelato."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Even I've gone there to eat a few times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "There's no way you eat gelato! Really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Imagine seeing you there, standing in line, surrounded by girls half your "
"age... not to mention your height."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "What's wrong with that?"
msgstr "Che c'è di male?"

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Nothing, I guess. Maybe seeing you eat gelato would help other guys to "
"loosen up and try it for themselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I should go there with one of the guys from the club sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a famous actor who goes to eat at Sushi Gin undercover. "
"Noboru Kudarizaka, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Oh... Okay."
msgstr "Oh... Va bene."

msgctxt "520"
msgid "That's all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"I'm honestly not a big fan of Noboru Kudarizaka, and besides, I can't eat "
"sushi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "It's the raw fish. I just can't wrap my taste buds around it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Sorry. I know you were just trying to tell me something interesting. I'm all"
" ears for something else, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I heard that the kimchi over at Kanrai is made with real peppers from Korea."
" Apparently it's really good for you, due to the... something-cin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"It's capsaicin. The stuff in the peppers, right? I heard it's pretty good "
"for dieting too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Yeah, that's it."
msgstr "Sì, esatto."

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"The kimchi over at Kanrai is probably one of the few foods that tastes good "
"and is good for you. Makes me want rice with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"It'd be even better if it didn't stink up the place... That goes for both "
"yakiniku and kimchi. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Heh. You're right about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "I heard the ramen over at Kyushu No. 1 Star has a lot of collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Ever since the previous owner came back, they started making authentic"
" tonkotsu ramen, the Kyushu way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"From what the owner says, they boil the pork bone in broth until it breaks "
"down into an immense mass of collagen, which is apparently very good for "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Wow... Guess I'll try that out sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "You know about the Yoshida Batting Center?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Oh, yeah. I go practice my swing there from time to time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"Ever run into a professional baseball player? Because apparently they'll "
"show up from time to time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Really? Here, in Kamurocho? Of all places..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Yeah. They put out some amazing scores, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Wow. Maybe I'll try to strike up a conversation with one. Networking, you "
"know? You can never do it enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid "Have you heard about the Matcha Fair over at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "No, I haven't, actually. What's that all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"It's something where they feature matcha-flavored desserts, like parfaits "
"and such."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Wow... That sounds delicious. I never go there, so that's definitely news to"
" me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Have you eaten the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Braised pork? And that's supposed to be a burger? Sounds weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Apparently it got popular because some idol blogged about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"Huh. I guess a blog would have that kind of impact, granted enough people "
"read it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "I have a blog of my own, so I would know. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "You too?"
msgstr "Anche tu?"

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"Yep. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You should check it out sometime. Maybe even "
"link it your friends. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"If you like shopping, you should check out Le Marche. I heard you can order "
"whatever bag you want there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "What!? Really?"
msgstr "Cosa!? Davvero!?"

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Yeah, they go over to Europe every two months to stock up on new bags. So if"
" you make an order with the owner before then, he'll probably be able to get"
" it for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"Get out! That is way too amazing! You see, there's this bag I've been "
"wanting for practically forever..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"It's never been brought over to Japan, either. So I kinda gave up on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"But now I can ask the owner about it next time I go! Good stuff, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"Ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a shochu made of perilla... a type of herb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Of course. Who doesn't know Tantakatan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "...Right. Well, apparently, it goes really good with juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. Add a little cranberry juice, and you have yourself a cocktail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid ""
"It's actually pretty smooth on the rocks, too... Guess there's no wrong way "
"to drink it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Did you end up going to Gelateria Kamuro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, and guess what! There were a ton of businessmen there who must've "
"just gotten off work! It was intense. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"I ended up buying one of every flavor so we could have a gelato party here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "A gelato party?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"Yeah. You order a bunch of gelato and eat as much as you want. I personally "
"like the caffè mocha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah, there was some dry ice that came with the packaging, so we poured "
"water over it and made a bunch of smoke. It was off the hook... kinda like a"
" music video! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "It's nice that you can do that on the job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid ""
"Oh for sure, the customers were totally digging it. Guess even guys want "
"something sweet every now and then. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "So, there's this famous actor who goes to Sushi Gin..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you told me before. I'm not into Noboru Kudarizaka, and I told you, I "
"can't eat sushi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Hmph. Guess you weren't listening to me at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Did you get to try Kanrai's kimchi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"Yep, and after hearing you talk about it, it piqued my curiosity, so I took "
"some of the girls there after work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"We ended up ordering a bunch of kimchi, and even made friends with the "
"staff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid ""
"So they gave us a bunch of kimchi to take home. How thoughtful, right? "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"Thanks to you, I'm gonna be kimchi'd out every day now! "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and the smell there... I dunno, but don't you think it's a little too "
"strong?  Like, the smell got stuck in my hair for two entire days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "I could hardly keep the dogs from sniffing around my head at night..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid ""
"True, the smell of their tonkotsu is pretty strong. But so is the flavor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid ""
"Well, the day after I ate it, my skin got really smooth, so I guess it "
"wasn't all bad. Collagen's amazing, isn't it? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Have you been to the Yoshida Batting Center?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Yeah, I went, but... none of the pros showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "I wanted to challenge them, too... Now I'm super disappointed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Well, I doubt you'd run into one right off the bat... Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Have I told you about the Matcha Fair over at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "Yeah, you have. But I don't go to Nakamichi Street that much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "Have you tried that pork burger yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Nope, not yet. But doesn't that sound kinda wrong to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'm just hating on it without actually trying it, but still. It's "
"probably not my thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Did you get to reserve anything at Le Marche?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"I did! Next month when they go off to buy stuff, they said they're gonna "
"look for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"Oooh, I can't wait! Now I can finally get that bag I've been agonizing "
"over..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid ""
"You have no idea how much this means to me, Kiryu-san! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I promise I'll find some way to repay you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"Have you ever tried Tantakatan with cranberry juice? It's pretty good that "
"way. Or you can just drink it straight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"That... is almost word for word something I already told you. Did you "
"forget?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "Oh. Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid ""
"You're a mess, Kiryu-san. As punishment, you have to order a ton of drinks "
"today."
msgstr ""

